{% comment %}
  Text for a marked-down product's badge (compare-at price above price).

  "Sale" is reserved for sale events: products tagged `sale`, in any capitalization. The same tag
  puts a product in the Sale collection. Every other markdown reads "Clearance", matching the
  Clearance collection (price reduced, not tagged `sale`).

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object

  Usage:
  {% render 'markdown-badge-label', product: product %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign tags = product.tags | join: '|' | downcase | split: '|'
  if tags contains 'sale'
    echo 'products.product.on_sale' | t
  else
    echo 'products.product.clearance' | t
  endif
-%}
